---
import { calculateRepoStress, DEFAULT_REPO_INPUT } from '../lib/repo-stress.mjs';
interface Props { lang?: 'fr' | 'en'; }
const { lang = 'fr' } = Astro.props;
const initial = calculateRepoStress(DEFAULT_REPO_INPUT);
const nf = new Intl.NumberFormat(lang === 'fr' ? 'fr-FR' : 'en-GB', {maximumFractionDigits:2});
const money = (value: number) => lang === 'fr' ? nf.format(value)+' M€' : '€'+nf.format(value)+'m';
const soldWidth = initial.saleShare*820;
---
{lang === 'en' ? (
<section class="repo-lab" id="repo-lab-en" data-repo-lab="" data-lang="en" aria-labelledby="repo-title-en">
<div class="lab-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE REPO LAB</p><h2 id="repo-title-en">How much must be sold to restore funding?</h2><p>Change the price, haircut or cash buffer. The calculation tracks collateral removed by each sale.</p></div>
<p class="lab-warning">An isolated position before hedging, at an assumed constant stressed price. This is not a simulation of the French market or a crisis probability.</p>
<form novalidate autocomplete="off"><fieldset data-inputs="" disabled>
<legend>Editable assumptions</legend><div class="lab-inputs">
<div class="lab-field"><label for="repo-en-position">Initial bond position (€m)</label><input id="repo-en-position" name="position" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="1" max="10000" step="1" value="100" required aria-describedby="repo-en-position-help"/><small id="repo-en-position-help">Market value before the shock.</small></div>
<div class="lab-field"><label for="repo-en-haircutBefore">Initial collateral haircut (%)</label><input id="repo-en-haircutBefore" name="haircutBefore" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="1" max="20" step="0.1" value="2" required aria-describedby="repo-en-haircutBefore-help"/><small id="repo-en-haircutBefore-help">Share not financed through the repo.</small></div>
<div class="lab-field"><label for="repo-en-haircutAfter">Haircut at refinancing (%)</label><input id="repo-en-haircutAfter" name="haircutAfter" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="1" max="40" step="0.1" value="5" required aria-describedby="repo-en-haircutAfter-help"/><small id="repo-en-haircutAfter-help">Must not be below the initial haircut.</small></div>
<div class="lab-field"><label for="repo-en-priceFall">Fall in bond prices (%)</label><input id="repo-en-priceFall" name="priceFall" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="10" step="0.1" value="2" required aria-describedby="repo-en-priceFall-help"/><small id="repo-en-priceFall-help">A price shock, not a yield increase.</small></div>
<div class="lab-field"><label for="repo-en-cashBuffer">Separate cash buffer (€m)</label><input id="repo-en-cashBuffer" name="cashBuffer" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="10000" step="0.1" value="1" required aria-describedby="repo-en-cashBuffer-help"/><small id="repo-en-cashBuffer-help">No more than the initial position value.</small></div>
<div class="lab-field lab-submit"><button type="submit">Recalculate</button><small>Values stay within this page.</small></div></div>
<div class="lab-presets"><span>Compare:</span><button type="button" data-preset="default">Article example</button><button type="button" data-preset="haircut">Haircut only</button><button type="button" data-preset="buffer">€5m cash buffer</button></div></fieldset></form>
<noscript><p class="lab-warning">JavaScript is disabled: controls are inactive. The initial example remains visible below and its calculation is explained in the article.</p></noscript>
<p class="lab-pending" data-pending hidden>Assumptions changed. Recalculate to display the result.</p><p class="lab-error" data-error="" role="alert" hidden></p><p class="visually-hidden" data-status="" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
<div data-results="" class="lab-results">
<h3>From allowed credit to required sales</h3>
<div class="lab-ledger"><p><span>Repo debt before the shock</span><strong data-output="debtBefore">{money(initial.debtBefore)}</strong></p><p><span>Collateral after the price fall</span><strong data-output="valueAfter">{money(initial.valueAfter)}</strong></p><p><span>Credit now permitted</span><strong data-output="loanCapacity">{money(initial.loanCapacity)}</strong></p><p class="ledger-call"><span>Required reduction in borrowing</span><strong data-output="liquidityCall">{money(initial.liquidityCall)}</strong></p><p><span>Cash buffer used</span><strong data-output="cashUsed">{money(initial.cashUsed)}</strong></p><p><span>Gap remaining before sales</span><strong data-output="gap">{money(initial.gap)}</strong></p></div>
<p class="lab-sale">Required sales: <strong data-output="sale">{money(initial.sale)}</strong> <span>(<strong data-output="saleShare">{nf.format(initial.saleShare*100)} %</strong> of the post-shock position)</span></p>
<svg class="lab-bar" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 900 80" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="repo-bar-title-en repo-bar-desc-en"><title id="repo-bar-title-en">Position split after sales</title><desc id="repo-bar-desc-en" data-output="barDesc">78 million sold; 20 million retained.</desc><rect x="40" y="24" width={soldWidth} height="40" fill="var(--color-accent)" data-sold-bar=""/><rect x={40+soldWidth} y="24" width={820-soldWidth} height="40" fill="var(--color-signal)" data-kept-bar=""/></svg><div class="lab-bar-labels"><span data-output="barSold">€78m sold</span><span data-output="barKept">€20m retained</span></div>
<p>Remaining: <strong data-output="remainingCollateral">{money(initial.remainingCollateral)}</strong> of collateral and <strong data-output="remainingDebt">{money(initial.remainingDebt)}</strong> of repo debt.</p>
<p class="lab-status" data-output="status">After these sales, financing satisfies the haircut at the assumed unchanged stressed price.</p>
<p class="lab-error" data-uncovered="" hidden>Uncovered debt after full liquidation: <strong data-output="uncoveredDebt">{money(initial.uncoveredDebt)}</strong></p>
<details><summary>Break down the result and read the limitations</summary>
<p>Bond price loss: <strong data-output="priceLoss">{money(initial.priceLoss)}</strong>. Price-driven loss of borrowing capacity is <strong data-output="priceContribution">{money(initial.priceContribution)}</strong> ; the haircut-driven loss is <strong data-output="haircutContribution">{money(initial.haircutContribution)}</strong>. These liquidity requirements are not an additional investment loss on top of the price loss.</p>
<p>Initial leverage of this position: <strong data-output="positionLeverage">50× (excluding cash and derivatives)</strong>.</p>
<p>The model assumes a contractually permitted haircut reset at refinancing, sales at a constant stressed price, all sale proceeds used to repay repo debt and no other financing. It excludes accrued interest, fees, derivatives, tax, settlement delays and price impact. A hedged position must be assessed across both legs and their margin timing. This model covers positive, non-decreasing haircuts only; zero and negative haircuts are excluded.</p>
<p class="lab-formula">Sales = gap after cash ÷ final haircut. If that exceeds remaining collateral, the tool shows full liquidation and uncovered debt.</p></details></div></section>
) : (
<section class="repo-lab" id="repo-lab-fr" data-repo-lab="" data-lang="fr" aria-labelledby="repo-title-fr">
<div class="lab-heading"><p class="eyebrow">LE LABORATOIRE DU REPO</p><h2 id="repo-title-fr">Combien vendre pour respecter la décote ?</h2><p>Changez le prix, la décote ou la réserve. Le calcul suit la garantie retirée à chaque vente.</p></div>
<p class="lab-warning">Modèle d’une position isolée avant couverture, au prix stressé supposé constant. Ce n’est pas une simulation du marché français ni une probabilité de crise.</p>
<form novalidate autocomplete="off"><fieldset data-inputs="" disabled>
<legend>Hypothèses modifiables</legend><div class="lab-inputs">
<div class="lab-field"><label for="repo-fr-position">Position obligataire initiale (M€)</label><input id="repo-fr-position" name="position" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="1" max="10000" step="1" value="100" required aria-describedby="repo-fr-position-help"/><small id="repo-fr-position-help">Valeur de marché avant le choc.</small></div>
<div class="lab-field"><label for="repo-fr-haircutBefore">Décote de garantie initiale (%)</label><input id="repo-fr-haircutBefore" name="haircutBefore" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="1" max="20" step="0.1" value="2" required aria-describedby="repo-fr-haircutBefore-help"/><small id="repo-fr-haircutBefore-help">Part des titres non financée par le repo.</small></div>
<div class="lab-field"><label for="repo-fr-haircutAfter">Décote au refinancement (%)</label><input id="repo-fr-haircutAfter" name="haircutAfter" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="1" max="40" step="0.1" value="5" required aria-describedby="repo-fr-haircutAfter-help"/><small id="repo-fr-haircutAfter-help">Au moins égale à la décote initiale.</small></div>
<div class="lab-field"><label for="repo-fr-priceFall">Baisse du prix des obligations (%)</label><input id="repo-fr-priceFall" name="priceFall" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="10" step="0.1" value="2" required aria-describedby="repo-fr-priceFall-help"/><small id="repo-fr-priceFall-help">Un choc de prix, pas une hausse de taux.</small></div>
<div class="lab-field"><label for="repo-fr-cashBuffer">Réserve de trésorerie séparée (M€)</label><input id="repo-fr-cashBuffer" name="cashBuffer" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="10000" step="0.1" value="1" required aria-describedby="repo-fr-cashBuffer-help"/><small id="repo-fr-cashBuffer-help">Au maximum la valeur de la position initiale.</small></div>
<div class="lab-field lab-submit"><button type="submit">Recalculer</button><small>Les valeurs restent dans cette page.</small></div></div>
<div class="lab-presets"><span>Comparer :</span><button type="button" data-preset="default">Exemple de l’article</button><button type="button" data-preset="haircut">Décote seule</button><button type="button" data-preset="buffer">Réserve de 5 M€</button></div></fieldset></form>
<noscript><p class="lab-warning">JavaScript est désactivé : les commandes sont inactives. Le résultat de l’exemple initial reste lisible ci-dessous et son calcul est détaillé dans l’article.</p></noscript>
<p class="lab-pending" data-pending hidden>Hypothèses modifiées. Recalculez pour afficher le résultat.</p><p class="lab-error" data-error="" role="alert" hidden></p><p class="visually-hidden" data-status="" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
<div data-results="" class="lab-results">
<h3>Du crédit autorisé aux ventes nécessaires</h3>
<div class="lab-ledger"><p><span>Dette en repo avant le choc</span><strong data-output="debtBefore">{money(initial.debtBefore)}</strong></p><p><span>Garantie après la baisse du prix</span><strong data-output="valueAfter">{money(initial.valueAfter)}</strong></p><p><span>Crédit désormais autorisé</span><strong data-output="loanCapacity">{money(initial.loanCapacity)}</strong></p><p class="ledger-call"><span>Réduction du crédit exigée</span><strong data-output="liquidityCall">{money(initial.liquidityCall)}</strong></p><p><span>Réserve utilisée</span><strong data-output="cashUsed">{money(initial.cashUsed)}</strong></p><p><span>Manque restant avant les ventes</span><strong data-output="gap">{money(initial.gap)}</strong></p></div>
<p class="lab-sale">Ventes nécessaires : <strong data-output="sale">{money(initial.sale)}</strong> <span>(<strong data-output="saleShare">{nf.format(initial.saleShare*100)} %</strong> des titres après choc)</span></p>
<svg class="lab-bar" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 900 80" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="repo-bar-title-fr repo-bar-desc-fr"><title id="repo-bar-title-fr">Répartition de la position après ventes</title><desc id="repo-bar-desc-fr" data-output="barDesc">78 millions vendus ; 20 millions conservés.</desc><rect x="40" y="24" width={soldWidth} height="40" fill="var(--color-accent)" data-sold-bar=""/><rect x={40+soldWidth} y="24" width={820-soldWidth} height="40" fill="var(--color-signal)" data-kept-bar=""/></svg><div class="lab-bar-labels"><span data-output="barSold">78 M€ vendus</span><span data-output="barKept">20 M€ conservés</span></div>
<p>Il reste <strong data-output="remainingCollateral">{money(initial.remainingCollateral)}</strong> de garantie et <strong data-output="remainingDebt">{money(initial.remainingDebt)}</strong> de dette en repo.</p>
<p class="lab-status" data-output="status">Le financement redevient compatible avec la décote après ces ventes, au prix stressé supposé constant.</p>
<p class="lab-error" data-uncovered="" hidden>Dette non couverte après liquidation totale : <strong data-output="uncoveredDebt">{money(initial.uncoveredDebt)}</strong></p>
<details><summary>Décomposer le résultat et lire les limites</summary>
<p>Perte de valeur de l’obligation : <strong data-output="priceLoss">{money(initial.priceLoss)}</strong>. La baisse de capacité de financement liée au prix vaut <strong data-output="priceContribution">{money(initial.priceContribution)}</strong> ; celle liée à la décote vaut <strong data-output="haircutContribution">{money(initial.haircutContribution)}</strong>. Ces appels de liquidité ne s’ajoutent pas à la perte de valeur comme une nouvelle perte économique.</p>
<p>Levier initial de cette position : <strong data-output="positionLeverage">50× (hors réserve et dérivés)</strong>.</p>
<p>L’outil suppose que le prêteur peut modifier la décote au refinancement, que les ventes se font au même prix, que leur produit rembourse le repo et qu’aucun autre financement n’est disponible. Il exclut intérêts courus, frais, dérivés, fiscalité, délais de règlement et impact des ventes sur les prix. Une position couverte doit être analysée avec ses deux jambes et leurs calendriers de marge. Le modèle retient des décotes positives et non décroissantes ; les décotes nulles et négatives sont exclues.</p>
<p class="lab-formula">Ventes = manque après réserve ÷ décote finale. Si ce montant dépasse la garantie restante, l’outil affiche la liquidation totale et la dette non couverte.</p></details></div></section>
)}
<script>
  import '../lib/repo-lab-ui.mjs';
</script>

<style>
  .repo-lab { margin: 2.5rem 0 3rem; padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.75rem); border: 1px solid var(--color-line-strong); border-top: 3px solid var(--color-signal); border-radius: .75rem; background: var(--color-surface); color: var(--color-paper); font-family: var(--font-read); font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.6; scroll-margin-top: 6rem; }
  .repo-lab * { box-sizing: border-box; min-width: 0; }
  .repo-lab p { margin: .75rem 0; }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--color-signal); font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .12em; font-weight: 700; }
  .repo-lab h2 { margin: .5rem 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.8rem); line-height: 1.25; }
  .repo-lab h3 { margin: 1rem 0; font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .lab-warning { border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent); padding: .5rem .9rem; font-size: .85rem; }
  fieldset { border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 1.5rem 0 0; }
  legend { padding: 0 0 1rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .lab-inputs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .lab-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .4rem; }
  label { font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; min-height: 2.4em; }
  input { width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--color-muted); background: var(--color-ink); color: var(--color-paper); padding: .65rem; border-radius: .3rem; font: inherit; font-size: 1.1rem; min-height: 44px; }
  small { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: .75rem; line-height: 1.45; }
  button { cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid var(--color-muted); border-radius: .3rem; padding: .55rem .8rem; min-height: 44px; background: var(--color-surface); color: var(--color-paper); font: inherit; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; }
  button:hover { border-color: var(--color-signal); }
  button[type=submit] { background: var(--color-signal); color: var(--color-ink); border-color: var(--color-signal); }
  .repo-lab :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 4px; }
  fieldset:disabled { opacity: .65; }
  .lab-submit { justify-content: center; }
  .lab-presets { display: flex; gap: .5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; margin-top: 1rem; font-size: .8rem; }
  .lab-results { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line-strong); margin-top: 1.5rem; padding-top: .25rem; }
  .lab-ledger { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0 1.25rem; }
  .lab-ledger p { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: .65rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line-strong); font-size: .8rem; padding: .7rem 0; margin: 0; }
  .lab-ledger strong { font-size: 1rem; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ledger-call, .lab-sale>strong, .lab-bar-labels span:first-child { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .lab-sale { font-weight: 600; }
  .lab-sale>strong { font-size: 2rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .lab-sale>span { display: block; font-size: .85rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-weight: 400; }
  .lab-bar { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .lab-bar-labels { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; margin: .35rem 4.44% 1rem; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .lab-bar-labels span:last-child { color: var(--color-signal); }
  .lab-status { border-left: 3px solid var(--color-signal); padding: .6rem .9rem; font-size: .85rem; }
  details { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: .85rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line-strong); padding-top: 1rem; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
  .lab-formula { font-weight: 600; }
  .lab-error, .lab-pending { border: 1px solid var(--color-accent); padding: .75rem; }
  [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .visually-hidden { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(50%); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 780px) { .lab-inputs { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .lab-ledger { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 460px) { .lab-inputs { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } label { min-height: 0; } .lab-presets { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media print { form { display: none; } }
</style>
